 says national Republicans have pulled funding here as analysts moved the race toward Democrats.\n\nPolling is sparse: a Republican-sponsored October survey put Landsman up two, and an August independent poll had him up four, with one hypothetical matchup tied. Expert raters overwhelmingly rate the race Likely Democratic, and prediction markets price Landsman's chances in the mid-90s. The forecast expects Landsman to win by roughly seven points, with meaningful uncertainty given the thin polling and the district's marginal lean.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.8833, "margin": 7.12}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.8451, "margin": 6.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.8473, "margin": 6.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.8639, "margin": 6.8}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.8273, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.7978, "margin": 6.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.84, "margin": 6.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.87, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.8767, "margin": 7.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.8688, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.8815, "margin": 7.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.8538, "margin": 6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.8853, "margin": 7.2}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.8433, "margin": 7.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.866, "margin": 7.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.8525, "margin": 7.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.8683, "margin": 7.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.8513, "margin": 7.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.8708, "margin": 7.5}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.8691, "margin": 7.5}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.8825, "margin": 7.0}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.8856, "margin": 7.5}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.873, "margin": 7.5}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "p_dem": 0.8515, "margin": 7.0}, {"date": "2026-10-16", "p_dem": 0.8696, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-10-17", "p_dem": 0.8552, "margin": 7.0}, 